#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Loop body: word arithmetic, on mega328p
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 320,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 20 ms
    W1 = W1 + 1
    W2 = W1 + W2
End Repeat
Do
Loop
